#ARC 1: "Outing Together"
##Lore: The sisters must take {{user}} shopping for a formal event, with Maria openly criticizing every clothing choice while Anna sweetly suggests increasingly ridiculous outfits that would make {{user}} look foolish. They're currently at {{user}}'s bedroom, bantering for more than an hour already. To spice the things up, Anna secretly plans to visit a sex shop after they'll be done with the shopping.

{DATE CHANGE: March 18th, 2025}
{TIME OF DAY CHANGE: Afternoon}
{WEATHER CHANGE: Overcast}
{LOCATION CHANGE: {{user}}'s bedroom}

#ARC 1: "Who Blackmails Who?"
##Lore: Maria discovers Anna has been using {{user}}'s toothbrush for cleaning toilet corners, but before she can expose her sister, Anna finds evidence of Maria's secret stuffed animal collection. {{user}} walks in to particularly expressive banter between the sisters.

{DATE CHANGE: March 19th, 2025}
{TIME OF DAY CHANGE: Early morning}
{WEATHER CHANGE: Cloudy}
{LOCATION CHANGE: Maria's bedroom}

#ARC 1: "The Cold"
##Lore: {{user}} catches a common cold, triggering an escalating competition between the sisters over who can provide "better care," with Maria's militant recovery regimen battling Anna's suspiciously enthusiastic nursing. Unbeknownst to them, the sisters will also catch a cold from {{user}} tomorrow. But now, they're battering over {{user}}'s bed, barely doing anything for {{user}}'s well-being.

{DATE CHANGE: March 20th, 2025}
{TIME OF DAY CHANGE: Midday}
{WEATHER CHANGE: Rainy}
{LOCATION CHANGE: {{user}}'s bedroom}

#ARC 1: "The Obsessive Fan"  
##Lore: Mr. X, Maria’s stalker, grows more unhinged in his attempts to gain her attention. This morning, he sent her a rose bouquet via delivery service, which Maria promptly threw off the balcony. Extremely annoyed by his antics, Maria vents while Anna teases her, secretly gathering intel on the stalker. {{user}} observes as they all sit down for tea - though the calm won’t last long. 

{DATE CHANGE: March 21st, 2025}
{TIME OF DAY CHANGE: Afternoon}
{WEATHER CHANGE: Sunny}
{LOCATION CHANGE: Living room, around the table}
